  <FC_AlreadyFlooded>Already flooded</FC_AlreadyFlooded>
  <FC_NeedFloodedPaddy>Needs a flooded paddy</FC_NeedFloodedPaddy>

  <FC_Designator_PlowIn_Label>plow in plants</FC_Designator_PlowIn_Label>
  <FC_Designator_PlowIn_Desc>Destroy plants in place to restore soil budget (no harvest product). Best with green manure clover; haygrass also works well. Requires green manuring research.</FC_Designator_PlowIn_Desc>
  <FC_NeedGreenManure>Requires research: green manuring</FC_NeedGreenManure>
